msgid "2. Data We Collect"
msgstr ""

msgid "This application stores the following data to provide its services:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"User accounts: e-mail address, password hash, role, team assignment and "
"language/theme preferences."
msgstr ""

msgid "Player and team data: names, team memberships and active status."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Matchday and penalty data: dates, participants, penalties, payments and "
"balances."
msgstr ""

msgid "Audit logs: who changed which record and when."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Authentication cookies: a secure HttpOnly session cookie is used to keep you "
"logged in."
msgstr ""

msgid "3. Purpose of Data Processing"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Data is processed exclusively to operate the club's penalty system, "
"including matchday planning, balances and financial reporting."
msgstr ""

msgid "4. Cookies"
msgstr ""

msgid "This website uses the following cookies:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Session cookie (HttpOnly):"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Required for login sessions. This cookie is essential and cannot be declined."
msgstr ""

msgid "CSRF and language cookies:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Required for secure forms and your language choice. These cookies are "
"essential and cannot be declined."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cookie consent flag:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Stored in your browser's localStorage after you confirm the cookie notice. "
"This cookie is essential and cannot be declined."
msgstr ""

msgid "No third-party tracking or analytics cookies are used."
msgstr ""

msgid "5. Data Retention"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Data is retained as long as necessary for the operation of the penalty "
"system. Matchday, penalty and audit records are preserved to maintain a "
"complete financial history."
msgstr ""

